# Raw dataset downloads are large and re-fetchable; the BUILT corpus is not.
# data/debug/{corpus,examples,manifest}.json* ARE committed (4.9 MB total) so the repo
# is self-contained: clone and the whole pipeline runs without the 1.7 GB FEVER dump.
# The FAISS index is NOT committed -- it is 74 MB, rebuilds in 39 s, and is keyed by
# the corpus fingerprint anyway.
data/raw/
